<title>USA: Unimar Q1 cash flow up, shipments to fall.</title>
<headline>Unimar Q1 cash flow up, shipments to fall.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unimar Co said Thursday that its net cash flow generated from the sale of liquified natural gas from its interest in the Indonesian Joint Venture was $30.7 million in the first quarter, up from $28.8 million in the 1996 quarter.</p>
<p>The company, which has a 23.125 percent interest in the Indonesian venture, said the venture's share of liquified natural gas delivered fell 21 percent to 92 trillion BTUs.</p>
</text>
